id: pm-lint-41oh
title: Register merge drivers during CI install
description: CI health fails because npm ci never registers the field-aware merge drivers and the merge fence is not tracked. Install them from the canonical prepare hook and commit the fence generated by the pinned pm.
type: Task
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags[2]: ci,merge-drivers
created_at: "2026-10-13T14:25:02.875Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-13T14:42:15.189Z"
author: pi-grok
acceptance_criteria: npm ci runs the canonical prepare hook; the tracked merge fence matches pm merge install; artifact creation skips driver installation without changing git config; release checks and the CI health command pass
parent: pm-lint-gate
comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-13T14:27:04.019Z",pi-grok,"Plan: copy the canonical prepare-merge-driver launcher unchanged, point package.json prepare at it, and commit the merge fence already generated by the pinned pm. Add a child-process suite on fresh git init checkouts, including the artifact-creation skip that must leave git config byte-identical and print one notice."
  "2026-10-13T14:31:30.346Z",pi-grok,"Revert proof: disabling the artifact-creation guard made the pack regression fail with exit 1 because stderr was empty instead of the single skip notice. Removing the installer spawn made the full-install regression fail with exit 1 and register none of the five fence drivers. The launcher was restored byte-identical to the canonical template. Hiding the merge fence made the strict merge-driver health command fail with merge_fence_drift. npm pack --dry-run prints the pack skip notice and still packs only the allowlisted files. The prepare-hook suite is 9/9 and the launcher measures 100 percent on every coverage dimension."
  "2026-10-13T14:39:26.988Z",pi-grok,"Gates: isolated npm run release:check and bun run release:check both passed. Identity 0 violations, duplication 0/3109, 78 unit tests passed including the 9 prepare-hook tests, coverage 100/100/100/100 across 15 source files, production audit 0 vulnerabilities, changelog current, packed npm/npx and native Bun/bunx acceptance 1/1. npm pack --dry-run skipped merge-driver install and packed 29 allowlisted files."
files[4]{path,scope}:
  .gitattributes,project
  package.json,project
  scripts/prepare-merge-driver.ts,project
  test/prepare-merge-driver.test.ts,project
tests[3]{command,scope,provenance{author,created_at,source_kind,source_ref}}:
  node --test test/prepare-merge-driver.test.ts,project,pi-grok,"2026-10-13T14:31:22.623Z",local_mutation,feat/authoring-lint-rules
  "npm run release:check",project,pi-grok,"2026-10-13T14:31:24.981Z",local_mutation,feat/authoring-lint-rules
  "bun run release:check",project,pi-grok,"2026-10-13T14:31:27.651Z",local_mutation,feat/authoring-lint-rules
body: ""
